WEBVTT

00:09:29.267 --> 00:09:31.415
znači da možete uzeti stanicu,

00:09:31.415 --> 00:09:33.701
koja je pluripotentna matična stanica.

00:09:33.701 --> 00:09:36.385
Ta stanica je poput skijaša na vrhu planine,

00:09:36.385 --> 00:09:40.202
a ova dva skijaša postanu dvije pluripotentne matične stanice,

00:09:40.202 --> 00:09:41.984
četiri, osam, 16,

00:09:41.984 --> 00:09:43.652
i tada nastaje takva gužva

00:09:43.652 --> 00:09:45.452
nakon 16 dijeljenja

00:09:45.452 --> 00:09:47.954
da se te stanice moraju diferencirati.

00:09:47.954 --> 00:09:49.387
Dakle, spuste se niz jednu stranu planine,

00:09:49.387 --> 00:09:50.620
spuste se niz drugu.

00:09:50.620 --> 00:09:52.154
I kako to odaberu,

00:09:52.154 --> 00:09:54.404
postaju kosti,

00:09:54.404 --> 00:09:57.336
a onda odaberu drugu stazu i postaju trombociti,

00:09:57.336 --> 00:09:59.453
ove postaju makrofagi,

00:09:59.453 --> 00:10:00.720
a ove postaju T limfociti.